 ## Local Lite3 simulation adapter
 
 This experiment adds `python -m vln_mujoco --robot lite3 --robot-model PATH --walking-policy PATH`. It requires the pinned model_149999 ONNX export and prepared Lite3 MJCF. It uses 1 ms physical integration, a 50 Hz walking policy, and a body-mounted RGB camera; it does not control physical hardware.
+
+### Controlled Lite3 scenes
+
+`--scene-model PATH` selects a task-owned MJCF scene for `--robot lite3`. It preserves the robot camera and controllers. Obstacle/boundary contacts are accumulated at every 1 ms physical substep and exposed as telemetry; they do not control navigation.
